---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Pest Control FAQ | Zero Pest Control"
description: "Answers to common residential pest control questions for homeowners in Sudbury, Espanola, Elliot Lake, Blind River, Manitoulin, and Sault Ste. Marie."
permalink: /faq/
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / FAQ</p>
    <h1>Residential Pest Control FAQs</h1>
    <p class="lede">Quick answers to common questions about protecting your home.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <div class="accordion reveal">
      {% set faqs = [
        { q: "How fast can you respond?", a: "We offer fast response times, often same-day or next-day depending on availability." },
        { q: "Are your treatments safe for my family?", a: "Yes. We use safe, approved treatments designed for residential environments." },
        { q: "Do I need to leave my home during treatment?", a: "In most cases, no. We'll let you know in advance if any preparation is needed." },
        { q: "What pests do you handle?", a: "We handle common household pests including ants, rodents, spiders, cockroaches, wasps, and more." },
        { q: "What if the pests come back?", a: "If the issue returns, we'll follow up and make sure it's properly resolved." },
        { q: "Should I get a one-time treatment or ongoing protection?", a: "If pests keep returning or you want long-term peace of mind, ongoing protection is the best option." },
        { q: "How much does pest control cost?", a: "Pricing depends on the type of pest and level of treatment needed. We provide clear recommendations after inspection." }
      ] %}
      {% for item in faqs %}
      <details class="accordion-item">
        <summary>{{ item.q }} {{ icon("chevron-down") }}</summary>
        <div class="accordion-body"><p>{{ item.a }}</p></div>
      </details>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <p class="text-center" style="margin-top:2rem; color:var(--ink-faint);">
      Have a question about a commercial account? See our <a href="/commercial-pest-plans/">Commercial Pest Plans</a> page or get in touch below.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-banner reveal">
      <div>
        <h2>Still Have Questions?</h2>
        <p>We're here to help — get clear answers and fast support for your home.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-banner-actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Get Fast Service Today</a>
        <a class="btn btn--outline-invert" href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ icon("phone") }} Call {{ site.phone }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

